        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \nOpening to\n\nInner Hall - \nStaircase to upper floor, door to\n\nCloakroom - \nWith wash hand basin and WC, tiled floor and part-tiled wall.\n\nLiving Room - \nMarble fireplace with ornate hardwood surround and gas coal effect fire. Sliding door to large rear terrace overlooking gardens to rear. Double doors to\n\nDining Room - \nDoor to terrace to rear and door to\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room - \nModern fitted kitchen with extensive array of fitted units, cupboards, drawers, display units, feature central island with breakfast bar area, double Zanussi over, hotpoint hob, Stanley range over and majestic picture window with views overlooking mountainside and grounds.\n\nUtility Room - \nStorage cupboards, plumbing for washing machine, door to guest WC with wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 6 - \nGuest bedroom area with built in wardrobes door Nursery Room and door to\n\nEnsuite - \nShower, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nNursery - \nWindow overlooking grounds to rear and door to store cupboard.\n\nRear Hall - \nStaircase to garden level.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding Area - \nDoor to hot press area and built in storage cupboards.\n\nSitting Room - \nWith feature wood burning stove, hardwood flooring and built in shelving and storage units. Double doors to\n\nSunroom - \nOverlooking grounds to the south.\n\nMain Bedroom - \nExtensive range of built in wardrobes, windows to rear and side overlooking grounds and Dublin City. Door to large ensuite bathroom area.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBuilt in wardrobes and door to ensuite bathroom.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nBuilt in wardrobes and windows to rear and side gardens. Door to ensuite bathroom.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nWindows overlooking gardens to side, built in wardrobes and door to ensuite bathroom.\n\nBedroom 5/Study - \nBuilt in wardrobes and door to ensuite bathroom.\n\nGarden Level - \n\n\nCentral Hall - \nDoor to storage cupboard.\n\nLaundry Room - \nWith storage area and central heating boiler.\n\nSelf Contained Studio - \n\n\nLiving Area - \nVery fine modern fitted kitchen with built in units, built in Beko oven and hob, hardwood flooring, dining / living area, door to rear grounds and double doors to\n\nBedroom - \nWith dressing room area\n\nSelf-Contained Accomodation - \n\n\nHallway - \nDoor from rear grounds, storage cupboard / cloakroom door to\n\nKitchen Area - \nFitted kitchen with range of cupboards, built in oven and hob, plumbing for washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nSitting Room - \nWindows overlooking rear grounds, dining area and door to central hall of main residence.\n\nMain Bedroom - \nDoor to walk in wardrobe area and door to ensuite bathroom.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBuilt in wardrobes and door to rear hallway.\n\nBathroom - \nWith double sized shower unit, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nGarage - 8m x 6m\nWith two vehicle entrances and staircase to overhead loft area measuring 8m x 3.1m.\n\nGardens - \nThis most exceptional property is set on approximately 1.4 acres of majestic private grounds stocked with an array of mature trees, shrubs, hedgerow and plants with meandering walkways against the backdrop of a bordering stream. An original stone cottage in need of refurbishment is also situated within the grounds of the property.\n\n"
